                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "82c16009-b326-3b49-9f7d-5f20aa91d54a",
                        "entry_id": "883c6c88-8a80-3664-8ed3-ef6cdfed9c2d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een lokroep waar iemand geen weerstand aan kan bieden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ebfc1fa-d077-4bda-8243-666e7d6972dc",
                                "sense_id": "82c16009-b326-3b49-9f7d-5f20aa91d54a",
                                "text": "Wie uiteindelijk over het monetair beleid gaat, is overigens een interessante kwestie. Het is begrijpelijk om politici als Trump net als Odysseus aan de mast vast te binden, zodat het sirenenzang van goedkoop, al te goedkoop geld geen gevolg krijgt. Daar staat dan tegenover de onwenselijkheid dat centrale bank presidenten te veel macht krijgen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c21944b8-f78e-4d76-bc31-406585e81419",
                                "sense_id": "82c16009-b326-3b49-9f7d-5f20aa91d54a",
                                "text": "Dan die standvastigheid. Ik ben ervan overtuigd dat latere generaties jou zullen aanwijzen als de eerste die heeft gebroken met de Nederlandse traditie van opportunistisch pragmatisme. Met jou heeft het Nederlandse electoraat eindelijk een roerganger van het statuur Colijn gekregen. En dus trek je je niets aan van de verleidelijke sirenenzang van het koor van economen dat om stimuleren smeekt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6dfce2ff-959d-405d-aaec-870e734b98b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "883c6c88-8a80-3664-8ed3-ef6cdfed9c2d",
                        "source_sense_id": "1e60b4fb-8a0f-3c51-87cc-9ad61697b6f1",
                        "source_sense_description": "gezang van de sirenen",
                        "target_lang_word": "siren song",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "siren song",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d35b447e-3cd6-351f-86fe-2669fd8cda89",
                                        "entry_id": "cbcc4fb7-deb2-39e8-9d32-705605ed3687",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An enticing but dangerous appeal, especially a misleading one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86a01582-153f-47e0-998a-f3fccd6cdf7c",
                                                "sense_id": "d35b447e-3cd6-351f-86fe-2669fd8cda89",
                                                "text": "Romance never sang to him her siren song, and Adventure had never shouted in his sluggish blood."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "712ae582-901e-41a7-9f3f-b0378ce2b7a4",
                                                "sense_id": "d35b447e-3cd6-351f-86fe-2669fd8cda89",
                                                "text": "Said World Bank president Robert Zoellick: \"Leaders must not heed the siren song of protectionist fixes. Economic isolationism can lead to a negative spiral of events.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f89d7745-38e2-4c2e-b460-ea7788596b28",
                                                "sense_id": "d35b447e-3cd6-351f-86fe-2669fd8cda89",
                                                "text": "They found Xinyi Du at the apex of the DUAL Core, a massive quantum computer which plunged away below them where a series of catwalks and maintenance accesses buzzed with drones and shone with dozens of blinking indicators. It was spinning; Wettle had never understood what practical reason a computer might have to spin, but perhaps it wasn't practical at all. Most of the Foundation's best scientists succumbed to some extent to the siren song of the rule of cool."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82166880-7364-46b7-8b06-18caf13c4e1f",
                                                "sense_id": "d35b447e-3cd6-351f-86fe-2669fd8cda89",
                                                "text": "Can center-ground politicians, who have long dominated democratic governments, find a way to quiet the siren song of angry, antiestablishment nationalism? And will America’s maestro of the siren song, President Donald Trump, prove a powerful inspiration, or a cautionary tale, for voters in other democracies?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
